+   - kubectl -n monitoring get pods
+   - kubectl -n flagger get pods
+   - kubectl -n istio-system get pods
+
+3) Check Flagger canary:
+   - kubectl -n aegis get canary aegis-admission-webhook -o yaml
+   - kubectl -n aegis describe canary aegis-admission-webhook
+
+4) Inspect evidence artifacts (uploaded to workflow artifacts and S3)
+   - Privacy decision report
+   - Canary manifest (signed)
+   - KMS rotation manifest & signature
+
+5) Observe alerts in Prometheus/Grafana
+   - Verify PrometheusRule alerts are loaded: kubectl -n monitoring get prometheusrules
