+6) Run MPC integration tests (locally or in CI)
+   - python3 ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/worker.py (local run_multiprocess will simulate parties)
+   - Run ops/secure_agg/production_mpc/tests/test_mpc_integration.py for local verification
+
+7) Post-drill review
+   - Ensure all artifacts are in evidence bucket and signed
+   - Produce incident notes and record any anomalies
